1, 3383, 293, 382, 731, 382, 4571, 291, 577, 281, 2543, 552, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04768848856654736, "compression_ratio": 1.6324110671936758, "no_speech_prob": 0.3629313111305237}, {"id": 41, "seek": 18800, "start": 209.0, "end": 211.0, "text": " they also show you how to choose them.", "tokens": [51414, 436, 611, 855, 291, 577, 281, 2826, 552, 13, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04768848856654736, "compression_ratio": 1.6324110671936758, "no_speech_prob": 0.3629313111305237}, {"id": 42, "seek": 18800, "start": 211.0, "end": 215.0, "text": " Right, that sounds good. How big are the classes?", "tokens": [51514, 1779, 11, 300, 3263, 665, 13, 1012, 955, 366, 264, 5359, 30, 51714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04768848856654736, "compression_ratio": 1.6324110671936758, "no_speech_prob": 0.3629313111305237}, {"id": 43, "seek": 21500, "start": 215.0, "end": 218.0, "text": " I'm not sure exactly but they'll be quite small.", "tokens": [50364, 286, 478, 406, 988, 2293, 457, 436, 603, 312, 1596, 1359, 13, 50514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 44, "seek": 21500, "start": 218.0, "end": 220.0, "text": " And could I get a private lesson there?", "tokens": [50514, 400, 727, 286, 483, 257, 4551, 6898, 456, 30, 50614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 45, "seek": 21500, "start": 220.0, "end": 223.0, "text": " I think so. Let me check.", "tokens": [50614, 286, 519, 370, 13, 961, 385, 1520, 13, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 46, "seek": 21500, "start": 223.0, "end": 226.0, "text": " Yes, they do offer those.", "tokens": [50764, 1079, 11, 436, 360, 2626, 729, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 47, "seek": 21500, "start": 226.0, "end": 229.0, "text": " Though in fact most of the people who attend the classes", "tokens": [50914, 10404, 294, 1186, 881, 295, 264, 561, 567, 6888, 264, 5359, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 48, "seek": 21500, "start": 229.0, "end": 231.0, "text": " find it's a nice way of getting to know one another.", "tokens": [51064, 915, 309, 311, 257, 1481, 636, 295, 1242, 281, 458, 472, 1071, 13, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 49, "seek": 21500, "start": 231.0, "end": 233.0, "text": " I suppose it must be, yes.", "tokens": [51164, 286, 7297, 309, 1633, 312, 11, 2086, 13, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 50, "seek": 21500, "start": 233.0, "end": 236.0, "text": " And this company has a special deal for clients", "tokens": [51264, 400, 341, 2237, 575, 257, 2121, 2028, 337, 6982, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 51, "seek": 21500, "start": 236.0, "end": 240.0, "text": " where they offer a discount of 20% if you return for a further class.", "tokens": [51414, 689, 436, 2626, 257, 11635, 295, 945, 4, 498, 291, 2736, 337, 257, 3052, 1508, 13, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 52, "seek": 21500, "start": 240.0, "end": 243.0, "text": " OK, but you said there were several classes.", "tokens": [51614, 2264, 11, 457, 291, 848, 456, 645, 2940, 5359, 13, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05267729187011719, "compression_ratio": 1.543859649122807, "no_speech_prob": 0.03132152929902077}, {"id": 53, "seek": 24300, "start": 243.0, "end": 248.0, "text": " That's right. Another one you might be interested in is Bond's Cookery School.", "tokens": [50364, 663, 311, 558, 13, 3996, 472, 291, 1062, 312, 3102, 294, 307, 23604, 311, 12259, 2109, 5070, 13, 50614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06463203591815496, "compression_ratio": 1.6485507246376812, "no_speech_prob": 0.04474607855081558}, {"id": 54, "seek": 24300, "start": 248.0, "end": 251.0, "text": " They're quite new. They just opened six months ago", "tokens": [50614, 814, 434, 1596, 777, 13, 814, 445, 5625, 2309, 2493, 2057, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06463203591815496, "compression_ratio": 1.6485507246376812, "no_speech_prob": 0.04474607855081558}, {"id": 55, "seek": 24300, "start": 251.0, "end": 253.0, "text": " but I've heard good things about them.", "tokens": [50764, 457, 286, 600, 2198, 665, 721, 466, 552, 13, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06463203591815496, "compression_ratio": 1.6485507246376812, "no_speech_prob": 0.04474607855081558}, {"id": 56, "seek": 24300, "start": 253.0, "end": 256.0, "text": " They concentrate on teaching you to prepare healthy food", "tokens": [50864, 814, 18089, 322, 4571, 291, 281, 5940, 4627, 1755, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06463203591815496, "compression_ratio": 1.6485507246376812, "no_speech_prob": 0.04474607855081558}, {"id": 57, "seek": 24300, "start": 256.0, "end": 259.0, "text": " and they have quite a lot of specialist staff.", "tokens": [51014, 293, 436, 362, 1596, 257, 688, 295, 17008, 3525, 13, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06463203591815496, "compression_ratio": 1.6485507246376812, "no_speech_prob": 0.04474607855081558}, {"id": 58, "seek": 24300, "start": 259.0, "end": 263.0, "text": " So is that food for people on a diet and things like that?", "tokens": [51164, 407, 307, 300, 1755, 337, 561, 322, 257, 6339, 293, 721, 411, 300, 30, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06463203591815496, "compression_ratio": 1.6485507246376812, "no_speech_prob": 0.04474607855081558}, {"id": 59, "seek": 24300, "start": 263.0, "end": 266.0, "text": " I don't know if I'd be interested in that.", "tokens": [51364, 286, 500, 380, 458, 498, 286, 1116, 312, 3102, 294, 300, 13, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06463203591815496, "compression_ratio": 1.6485507246376812, "no_speech_prob": 0.04474607855081558}, {"id": 60, "seek": 24300, "start": 266.0, "end": 271.0, "text": " Well, I don't think they particularly focus on low calorie diets or weight loss.", "tokens": [51514, 1042, 11, 286, 500, 380, 519, 436, 4098, 1879, 322, 2295, 35004, 33867, 420, 3364, 4470, 13, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06463203591815496, "compression_ratio": 1.6485507246376812, "no_speech_prob": 0.04474607855081558}, {"id": 61, "seek": 27100, "start": 271.0, "end": 275.0, "text": " It's more to do with recipes that look at specific needs", "tokens": [50364, 467, 311, 544, 281, 360, 365, 13035, 300, 574, 412, 2685, 2203, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06118764574565585, "compression_ratio": 1.6192170818505338, "no_speech_prob": 0.025567010045051575}, {"id": 62, "seek": 27100, "start": 275.0, "end": 279.0, "text": " like including ingredients that will help build up your bones", "tokens": [50564, 411, 3009, 6952, 300, 486, 854, 1322, 493, 428, 10491, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06118764574565585, "compression_ratio": 1.6192170818505338, "no_speech_prob": 0.025567010045051575}, {"id": 63, "seek": 27100, "start": 279.0, "end": 281.0, "text": " and make them stronger, that sort of thing.", "tokens": [50764, 293, 652, 552, 7249, 11, 300, 1333, 295, 551, 13, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06118764574565585, "compression_ratio": 1.6192170818505338, "no_speech_prob": 0.025567010045051575}, {"id": 64, "seek": 27100, "start": 281.0, "end": 286.0, "text": " I see. Well, I might be interested. I'm not sure.", "tokens": [50864, 286, 536, 13, 1042, 11, 286, 1062, 312, 3102, 13, 286, 478, 406, 988, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06118764574565585, "compression_ratio": 1.6192170818505338, "no_speech_prob": 0.025567010045051575}, {"id": 65, "seek": 27100, "start": 286.0, "end": 288.0, "text": " Do they have a website I could check?", "tokens": [51114, 1144, 436, 362, 257, 3144, 286, 727, 1520, 30, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06118764574565585, "compression_ratio": 1.6192170818505338, "no_speech_prob": 0.025567010045051575}, {"id": 66, "seek": 27100, "start": 288.0, "end": 292.0, "text": " Yes, just key in the name of the school. It'll come up.", "tokens": [51214, 1079, 11, 445, 2141, 294, 264, 1315, 295, 264, 1395, 13, 467, 603, 808, 493, 13, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06118764574565585, "compression_ratio": 1.6192170818505338, "no_speech_prob": 0.025567010045051575}, {"id": 67, "seek": 27100, "start": 292.0, "end": 294.0, "text": " And if you want to know more about them,", "tokens": [51414, 400, 498, 291, 528, 281, 458, 544, 466, 552, 11, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06118764574565585, "compression_ratio": 1.6192170818505338, "no_speech_prob": 0.025567010045051575}, {"id": 68, "seek": 27100, "start": 294.0, "end": 297.0, "text": " every Thursday evening they have a lecture at the school.", "tokens": [51514, 633, 10383, 5634, 436, 362, 257, 7991, 412, 264, 1395, 13, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06118764574565585, "compression_ratio": 1.6192170818505338, "no_speech_prob": 0.025567010045051575}, {"id": 69, "seek": 27100, "start": 297.0, "end": 300.0, "text": " It's free and you don't need to book or anything.", "tokens": [51664, 467, 311, 1737, 293, 291, 500, 380, 643, 281, 1446, 420, 1340, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06118764574565585, "compression_ratio": 1.6192170818505338, "no_speech_prob": 0.025567010045051575}, {"id": 70, "seek": 30000, "start": 300.0, "end": 302.0, "text": " Just turn up at 7.30.", "tokens": [50364, 1449, 1261, 493, 412, 1614, 13, 3446, 13, 50464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07472752755688082, "compression_ratio": 1.076086956521739, "no_speech_prob": 0.08322496712207794}, {"id": 71, "seek": 30000, "start": 302.0, "end": 306.0, "text": " And that might give you an idea of whether you want to go to an actual class.", "tokens": [50464, 400, 300, 1062, 976, 291, 364, 1558, 295, 1968, 291, 528, 281, 352, 281, 364, 3539, 1508, 13, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07472752755688082, "compression_ratio": 1.076086956521739, "no_speech_prob": 0.08322496712207794}, {"id": 72, "seek": 33000, "start": 330.0, "end": 342.0, "text": " Now listen and answer questions 7 to 10.", "tokens": [50364, 823, 2140, 293, 1867, 1651, 1614, 281, 1266, 13, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16540316068209135, "compression_ratio": 1.2533333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.09026516228914261}, {"id": 73, "seek": 33000, "start": 342.0, "end": 345.0, "text": " OK, there's one more place you might be interested in.", "tokens": [50964, 2264, 11, 456, 311, 472, 544, 1081, 291, 1062, 312, 3102, 294, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16540316068209135, "compression_ratio": 1.2533333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.09026516228914261}, {"id": 74, "seek": 33000, "start": 345.0, "end": 348.0, "text": " That's got a rather strange name.", "tokens": [51114, 663, 311, 658, 257, 2831, 5861, 1315, 13, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16540316068209135, "compression_ratio": 1.2533333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.09026516228914261}, {"id": 75, "seek": 33000, "start": 348.0, "end": 351.0, "text": " It's called the Arezza Centre.", "tokens": [51264, 467, 311, 1219, 264, 2014, 26786, 20764, 13, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16540316068209135, "compression_ratio": 1.2533333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.09026516228914261}, {"id": 76, "seek": 33000, "start": 351.0, "end": 356.0, "text": " That's spelled A-R-E-T-S-A.", "tokens": [51414, 663, 311, 34388, 316, 12, 49, 12, 36, 12, 51, 12, 50, 12, 32, 13, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16540316068209135, "compression_ratio": 1.2533333333333334, "no_speech_prob": 0.09026516228914261}, {"id": 77, "seek": 35600, "start": 356.0, "end": 357.0, "text": " OK.", "tokens": [50364, 2264, 13, 50414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 78, "seek": 35600, "start": 357.0, "end": 360.0, "text": " They've got a very good reputation.", "tokens": [50414, 814, 600, 658, 257, 588, 665, 13061, 13, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 79, "seek": 35600, "start": 360.0, "end": 362.0, "text": " They do a bit of meat and fish cookery,", "tokens": [50564, 814, 360, 257, 857, 295, 4615, 293, 3506, 2543, 2109, 11, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 80, "seek": 35600, "start": 362.0, "end": 366.0, "text": " but they mostly specialize in vegetarian dishes.", "tokens": [50664, 457, 436, 5240, 37938, 294, 25739, 10814, 13, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 81, "seek": 35600, "start": 366.0, "end": 370.0, "text": " Right. That's certainly an area I'd like to learn more about.", "tokens": [50864, 1779, 13, 663, 311, 3297, 364, 1859, 286, 1116, 411, 281, 1466, 544, 466, 13, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 82, "seek": 35600, "start": 370.0, "end": 373.0, "text": " I've got lots of friends who don't eat meat.", "tokens": [51064, 286, 600, 658, 3195, 295, 1855, 567, 500, 380, 1862, 4615, 13, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 83, "seek": 35600, "start": 373.0, "end": 376.0, "text": " In fact, I think I might have seen that school today.", "tokens": [51214, 682, 1186, 11, 286, 519, 286, 1062, 362, 1612, 300, 1395, 965, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 84, "seek": 35600, "start": 376.0, "end": 378.0, "text": " Is it just by the market?", "tokens": [51364, 1119, 309, 445, 538, 264, 2142, 30, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 85, "seek": 35600, "start": 378.0, "end": 382.0, "text": " That's right. So they don't have any problem getting their ingredients.", "tokens": [51464, 663, 311, 558, 13, 407, 436, 500, 380, 362, 604, 1154, 1242, 641, 6952, 13, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 86, "seek": 35600, "start": 382.0, "end": 384.0, "text": " They're right next door.", "tokens": [51664, 814, 434, 558, 958, 2853, 13, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.05601422526255375, "compression_ratio": 1.5725190839694656, "no_speech_prob": 0.21042907238006592}, {"id": 87, "seek": 38400, "start": 384.0, "end": 389.0, "text": " And they also offer a special two-hour course in how to use a knife.", "tokens": [50364, 400, 436, 611, 2626, 257, 2121, 732, 12, 18048, 1164, 294, 577, 281, 764, 257, 7976, 13, 50614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09783256644069559, "compression_ratio": 1.4979757085020242, "no_speech_prob": 0.030321909114718437}, {"id": 88, "seek": 38400, "start": 389.0, "end": 394.0, "text": " They cover all the different skills, buying them, sharpening, chopping techniques.", "tokens": [50614, 814, 2060, 439, 264, 819, 3942, 11, 6382, 552, 11, 8199, 4559, 11, 35205, 7512, 13, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09783256644069559, "compression_ratio": 1.4979757085020242, "no_speech_prob": 0.030321909114718437}, {"id": 89, "seek": 38400, "start": 394.0, "end": 398.0, "text": " It gets booked up quickly though, so you'd need to check it was available.", "tokens": [50864, 467, 2170, 26735, 493, 2661, 1673, 11, 370, 291, 1116, 643, 281, 1520, 309, 390, 2435, 13, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09783256644069559, "compression_ratio": 1.4979757085020242, "no_speech_prob": 0.030321909114718437}, {"id": 90, "seek": 38400, "start": 398.0, "end": 400.0, "text": " Right. Well, thank you very much.", "tokens": [51064, 1779, 13, 1042, 11, 1309, 291, 588, 709, 13, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09783256644069559, "compression_ratio": 1.4979757085020242, "no_speech_prob": 0.030321909114718437}, {"id": 91, "seek": 38400, "start": 400.0, "end": 402.0, "text": " I'll go and check that out.", "tokens": [51164, 286, 603, 352, 293, 1520, 300, 484, 13, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09783256644069559, "compression_ratio": 1.4979757085020242, "no_speech_prob": 0.030321909114718437}, {"id": 92, "seek": 38400, "start": 404.0, "end": 408.0, "text": " That is the end of section one.", "tokens": [51364, 663, 307, 264, 917, 295, 3541, 472, 13, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09783256644069559, "compression_ratio": 1.4979757085020242, "no_speech_prob": 0.030321909114718437}, {"id": 93, "seek": 38400, "start": 408.0, "end": 413.0, "text": " You now have half a minute to check your answers.", "tokens": [51564, 509, 586, 362, 1922, 257, 3456, 281, 1520, 428, 6338, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09783256644069559, "compression_ratio": 1.4979757085020242, "no_speech_prob": 0.030321909114718437}, {"id": 94, "seek": 41400, "start": 414.0, "end": 415.0, "text": " OK.", "tokens": [50364, 2264, 13, 50414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.5385553653423603, "compression_ratio": 0.8235294117647058, "no_speech_prob": 0.7581680417060852}, {"id": 95, "seek": 41400, "start": 441.0, "end": 443.0, "text": " Now turn to section two.", "tokens": [51714, 823, 1261, 281, 3541, 732, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.5385553653423603, "compression_ratio": 0.8235294117647058, "no_speech_prob": 0.7581680417060852}, {"id": 96, "seek": 44400, "start": 444.0, "end": 445.0, "text": " OK.", "tokens": [50364, 2264, 13, 50414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.6610094547271729, "compression_ratio": 0.2727272727272727, "no_speech_prob": 0.9061981439590454}], "language": "en"}